category: Video
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel gobject-introspection libglib2.0-devel libgstinterfaces1.0-devel libgstreamer1.0-devel libgtk3-devel libintl-devel libusb1.0-devel libxml2-devel python312-gi zlib-devel
sdesc: "Library for video acquisition using Genicam cameras (utilities)"
ldesc: "Aravis is a glib/gobject based library for video acquisition using Genicam
cameras. It currently only implements an ethernet camera protocol used for
industrial cameras."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/AravisProject/aravis
